---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="工作台"
  description="大学生方程式车队时期的建模与后来的 PCB、工程图:可旋转的 E32 车架 3D、从 gerber 渲染的电路板。已退役,留作记录。"
>
  <section class="page-head container-prose" data-reveal="focus">
    <p class="eyebrow">WORKBENCH</p>
    <h1><span class="grad">工作台</span></h1>
    <p class="desc">
      视觉代码之外,我动手做的部分。大学生方程式车队(车架组)时期攒下的建模和仿真,退役前后的 PCB 和工程图——不是主线,但机器人是软硬一体的,这些最终都会回到机器人上。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--gray" style="margin-top:2.6rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">TIMELINE</p>
        <h2>这几年都做了什么</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card bench-note" data-reveal="focus">
        <ul class="bench-timeline">
          <li>
            <span class="t">2025.10 – 2025.12</span>
            <div><strong>方程式车队 · 车架组(CATIA)</strong>练零件建模,画了 20 多个零件,最后一个完整的 E32 车架,导出 STEP 进 ANSYS 做了仿真。</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="t">2026.01 – 2026.03</span>
            <div><strong>PCB(立创EDA)</strong>51 单片机核心板、STM32F103VET6 开发板、一块窄长练习板,导出 gerber;USB 拓展坞画了一半。</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="t">2026.01 – 2026.07</span>
            <div><strong>NX (UG) 零件</strong>从 model 练习件到合页、铰链板、夹具、推车、钢板、举升器,20 多个 .prt,其中车架组的模型又回到了 NX 里继续改。</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="t">现在</span>
            <div><strong>已退役</strong>车队的事告一段落,这些模型、板子和图纸留在这里当记录。</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">PCB</p>
        <h2>画过的板子</h2>
        <p class="sub">从立创EDA 的原理图到布局布线,再导出 gerber。布线图直接从 gerber 文件分层渲染(红=顶层铜,蓝=底层铜,白=丝印),不是软件截图。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bench-grid bench-grid--two" data-reveal-group>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/pcb2d-mcu51.png" alt="51 单片机核心板布线图:红色顶层铜、蓝色底层铜、白色丝印" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>51 单片机核心板</strong>
            <span>2026.01 · 70×40 mm</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/pcb2d-stm32.png" alt="STM32F103VET6 开发板布线图:双排引脚、USB、SWD 调试口" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>STM32F103VET6 开发板</strong>
            <span>2026.02 · 100×80 mm</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/pcb2d-pcb1.png" alt="窄长型练习板布线图" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>PCB1 · 窄长练习板</strong>
            <span>2026.01 · 100×30 mm</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
        <div class="viewer3d-head">
          <strong>STM32 开发板 · 3D</strong>
          <span>拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer3d" data-viewer="pcb" data-tex-top="/images/workbench/pcb-stm32.png" data-size-w="100" data-size-h="80">
          <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
          <canvas aria-label="STM32 开发板可旋转 3D 视图"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--gray">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">3D MODELS</p>
        <h2>车架与模型</h2>
        <p class="sub">模型都可以拖动旋转、滚轮缩放。由 CATIA / NX 导出的 STEP 转成网格直接在浏览器里渲染,不经过截图。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
        <div class="viewer3d-head">
          <strong>E32 车架 · 方程式车队车架组</strong>
          <span>CATIA 建模 · 2025.12 · 轴距方向约 2.3 m</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer3d viewer3d--tall" data-viewer="stl" data-src="/models/frame-e32.stl" data-color="frame">
          <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
          <canvas aria-label="E32 车架可旋转 3D 视图"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bench-grid bench-grid--two" style="margin-top:1.4rem;">
        <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
          <div class="viewer3d-head">
            <strong>铰链板 · NX</strong>
            <span>2026.04 · STEP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="viewer3d" data-viewer="stl" data-src="/models/jiaolian.stl" data-color="steel">
            <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
            <canvas aria-label="铰链板可旋转 3D 视图"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
          <div class="viewer3d-head">
            <strong>仿真几何 · ANSYS</strong>
            <span>2026.07 · 车架仿真工程里的板件与杆件</span>
          </div>
          <div class="viewer3d" data-viewer="stl" data-src="/models/model-731.stl" data-color="steel">
            <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
            <canvas aria-label="仿真几何可旋转 3D 视图"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card bench-note" style="margin-top:1.4rem;" data-reveal="focus">
        <h3 class="bench-note-title">关于 NX 和 SolidWorks 的文件</h3>
        <p class="bench-note-text">
          NX 的 20 多个零件(model 练习件、合页、夹具、推车、推杆、钢板、举升器、车架组模型)是 .prt 私有格式,浏览器渲染不了,上面只放了导出过 STEP 的几件。
          SolidWorks 装了,还没有正式的模型文件。等有新的 STEP 导出,我会继续补进来。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">CAD</p>
        <h2>工程图练习</h2>
        <p class="sub">课程练习里画得还行的两张。从 DXF 矢量数据原样描线重新渲染,不是软件截图。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bench-grid bench-grid--two" data-reveal-group>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/cad-01.svg" alt="零件轮廓练习:带弧形顶部、腰型槽和挂钩缺口的支架轮廓线稿" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>零件轮廓</strong>
            <span>2025.12 · DXF 线稿</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/cad-02.svg" alt="三视图练习:组合体支架的主视图、俯视图与中心线线稿" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>三视图</strong>
            <span>2026.03 · DXF 线稿</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<script>
  import * as THREE from 'three';
  import { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';
  import { STLLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/STLLoader.js';

  // 渲染探针:标签页不可见时 IO 不触发,查看器保持未初始化(占位可见),绝不白屏
  function makeViewer(holder) {
    const canvas = holder.querySelector('canvas');
    const hint = holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint');
    let renderer;
    try {
      renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, antialias: true, alpha: true });
    } catch (e) {
      hint.textContent = '当前浏览器不支持 WebGL,3D 视图无法显示。';
      return null;
    }
    renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 1.5));
    const scene = new THREE.Scene();
    const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(38, 1, 0.001, 100);
    scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff, 0x50555c, 1.1));
    const key = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 1.6);
    key.position.set(3, 5, 4);
    scene.add(key);
    const fill = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xdde3ff, 0.5);
    fill.position.set(-4, -2, -3);
    scene.add(fill);

    const controls = new OrbitControls(camera, canvas);
    controls.enableDamping = true;
    controls.dampingFactor = 0.08;

    function fit(obj, dist = 1.9) {
      const box = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(obj);
      const sphere = box.getBoundingSphere(new THREE.Sphere());
      const c = sphere.center.clone();
      obj.position.sub(c);
      camera.position.set(c.x + sphere.radius * dist * 0.7, c.y + sphere.radius * dist * 0.55, c.z + sphere.radius * dist);
      camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);
      controls.target.set(0, 0, 0);
      camera.near = sphere.radius / 100;
      camera.far = sphere.radius * 40;
      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
      return sphere.radius;
    }

    function resize() {
      const w = holder.clientWidth || 600;
      const h = holder.clientHeight || 400;
      renderer.setSize(w, h, false);
      camera.aspect = w / h;
      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
    }
    new ResizeObserver(resize).observe(holder);
    resize();

    let visible = true;
    let dirty = true;
    controls.addEventListener('change', () => { dirty = true; });
    new IntersectionObserver((es) => { visible = es.some((e) => e.isIntersecting); }).observe(holder);
    const clock = new THREE.Clock();
    (function loop() {
      requestAnimationFrame(loop);
      if (!visible) return;
      controls.update();
      if (dirty || controls.dampingFactor > 0) {
        renderer.render(scene, camera);
        dirty = false;
      }
      clock.getDelta();
    })();
    return { scene, camera, controls, fit, renderer };
  }

  const COLORS = {
    frame: 0x9aa2ad,
    steel: 0x8f979f,
  };

  function initStl(holder) {
    const v = makeViewer(holder);
    if (!v) return;
    new STLLoader().load(
      holder.dataset.src,
      (geo) => {
        geo.computeVertexNormals();
        const mat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({
          color: COLORS[holder.dataset.color] || 0x9aa2ad,
          metalness: 0.35,
          roughness: 0.5,
        });
        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geo, mat);
        v.scene.add(mesh);
        v.fit(mesh);
        holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint')?.remove();
      },
      undefined,
      () => {
        const h = holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint');
        if (h) h.textContent = '模型加载失败。';
      }
    );
  }

  function initPcb(holder) {
    const v = makeViewer(holder);
    if (!v) return;
    const w = (parseFloat(holder.dataset.sizeW) || 100) / 1000; // mm -> m
    const h = (parseFloat(holder.dataset.sizeH) || 80) / 1000;
    const t = 0.0016;
    const loader = new THREE.TextureLoader();
    loader.load(holder.dataset.texTop, (tex) => {
      tex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;
      const edge = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x35413a, roughness: 0.9 });
      const top = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ map: tex, roughness: 0.55, metalness: 0.25 });
      const bottom = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x8a4a3a, roughness: 0.7, metalness: 0.2 });
      const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w, t, h), [edge, edge, top, bottom, edge, edge]);
      v.scene.add(mesh);
      const r = v.fit(mesh, 2.3);
      // 薄板看侧面是黑的:相机抬高成俯视,板面朝上(此处覆盖 fit 的机位,dist 不生效)
      v.camera.position.set(r * 0.5, r * 1.9, r * 1.7);
      v.controls.target.set(0, 0, 0);
      v.controls.update();
      holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint')?.remove();
    });
  }

  function bind() {
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-viewer]').forEach((holder) => {
      if (holder.dataset.vBound) return;
      holder.dataset.vBound = '1';
      const init = holder.dataset.viewer === 'pcb' ? initPcb : initStl;
      // 进入视口再初始化,省显存
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((es) => {
        if (es.some((e) => e.isIntersecting)) {
          io.disconnect();
          init(holder);
        }
      }, { rootMargin: '120px' });
      io.observe(holder);
    });
  }
  bind();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', bind);
</script>
</Base>
